config BITOXIN_QA
	tristate "BITOXIN state-integrity probe"
	depends on DEBUG_FS
	help
	  Preemptible register-chain and retained-memory probe for QA campaigns,
	  with BITOXIN_PROBE() insertion points (see bitoxin_hook.h).

	  Built in (=y), it starts at boot with the module defaults, which
	  include one probe worker; boot with bitoxin_qa.threads=0 for the
	  hook alone. As a module (=m), only module callers reach the hook.
	  If unsure, say N.
